# VERIFIED_BY edge schema
# DesignContract → TestCase
# references: design_contract_id -> design_contract, test_case_id -> test_case
# csv_file: verified_by.csv
design_contract_id,test_case_id,coverage
# design_contract_id: Source DesignContract ID
# test_case_id: Target TestCase ID
# coverage: full|partial|negative (does this test fully verify, partially verify, or test error paths?)
